# ============================================================
# .dockerignore for Clinic Management System (ASP.NET Web Forms)
# Excludes build artifacts, IDE files, and non-runtime assets
# to reduce Docker build context size for EKS deployment.
# ============================================================

# ----- Build Output & Intermediate Directories -----
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/Debug/
**/Release/

# ----- NuGet Packages (restored during build stage) -----
**/packages/
**/*.nupkg
**/*.nuspec
**/.nuget/

# ----- IDE & Editor Files -----
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/*.user
**/*.suo
**/*.cache

# ----- PDB / Debug Symbol Files -----
**/*.pdb
**/*.mdb

# ----- Temporary & OS Files -----
**/Thumbs.db
**/*.DS_Store
**/desktop.ini
**/*.tmp
**/*.temp
**/*.log
**/*.bak
**/*.orig

# ----- Test Projects & Test Artifacts -----
**/*Test*/
**/*Tests*/
**/TestResults/
**/coverage/

# ----- Documentation & Non-Runtime Assets -----
README.md
LICENSE
*.pdf
images/
Database\ Files/
*.sql

# ----- Git Metadata -----
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes

# ----- CI/CD & Infrastructure Files -----
docker-compose*.yml
scripts/
docs/
kubernetes/

# ----- Roslyn Compiler Binaries (in SDK; not needed in runtime) -----
**/roslyn/
